<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Ingredient Checker</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">


    <%- include("./partials/head") %>

      <style> 
        .app-badge {
          width: 160px;
          margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        /* Social Icons */
        .social-icons {
          display: flex;
          gap: 16px;
        }

        .social-icons a {
          color: rgb(76, 76, 76);
          font-size: 20px;
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 900px) {
          .footer-container {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
          }
        }

        @media (max-width: 500px) {
          .footer-container {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          }
        }

        body {
          font-family: "Georgia", serif;
        }

        .image-collage {
          display: flex;
          gap: 20px;
          max-width: 1100px;
          margin-bottom: -100px;
          /* controls total height */
          height: 380px;
        }

        /* IMAGES */
        .image-collage img {
          width: 100%;
          height: 100%;
          object-fit: cover;
          border-radius: 18px;
        }



        /* MOBILE */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
          .image-collage {
            flex-direction: column;
            height: auto;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
          }
        }

        .image-collage img {
          height: 220px;
        }
      </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <%- include("./partials/nav") %>


      <div class="container mt-5">
        <div class="row justify-content-center">
          <div class="col-lg-9 text-center">

            <h2 class="mb-4 fw-bold">About Us</h2>

            

            <div class="image-collage">
              <img src="/image/waffle.png" alt="Waffle">
              <img src="/image/chco.png" alt="chco">
            </div>

            <p class="fs-6 mb-4">
              We are committed to raising awareness about the growing impact of
              <strong>ultra-processed foods</strong> on modern lifestyles. In today’s
              fast-paced world, convenience often replaces nutrition, leading to serious
              health and well-being challenges across all age groups.
            </p>

            <p class="fs-6 mb-4">
              Research shows that <strong>over 32 different health concerns</strong> have been
              linked to the regular consumption of ultra-processed foods. Despite these risks,
              such foods remain popular because they are <strong>around 52% cheaper</strong> than
              less processed alternatives, making them widely accessible even when they are not
              the healthiest option.
            </p>

            <p class="fs-6">
              The concern becomes more serious for children, as nearly
              <strong>67% of the foods consumed by children</strong> today are ultra-processed.
              Our mission is to educate, inform, and empower people to make healthier food choices
              and build a more nutritious future.
            </p>

          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <%- include("./partials/footer") %>
      <%- include("./partials/script") %>
  </body>

</html>